  <!-- ================= SECTION 1: HOW TO PUBLISH & GET YOUR URL ================= -->
  <h2>SECTION 1: How to Publish Your Website &amp; Get Your Live URL</h2>
  <p>To submit your live URL link on Google Classroom, you have <strong>three fast, free 1-minute publishing options</strong> since your code is already pushed to GitHub (<a href="https://github.com/Akanksha-124/The-Daily-Brew">https://github.com/Akanksha-124/The-Daily-Brew</a>):</p>

  <div class="proof-card">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1F1713;">Option A: 1-Click Instant Deploy via Vercel (Recommended)</h3>
    <ol style="margin-bottom: 4pt;">
      <li>Open <strong><a href="https://vercel.com/new">https://vercel.com/new</a></strong> and sign in with GitHub.</li>
      <li>Select your repository <strong><code>The-Daily-Brew</code></strong> and click <strong>"Import"</strong>.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>"Deploy"</strong> (all build settings are auto-detected as Vite).</li>
      <li>In ~30 seconds, Vercel gives you your live URL (e.g., <code>https://the-daily-brew-chi.vercel.app</code>).</li>
      <li><strong>Copy and paste this URL into Google Classroom!</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="proof-card">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1F1713;">Option B: 1-Click Deploy via Netlify</h3>
    <ol style="margin-bottom: 4pt;">
      <li>Open <strong><a href="https://app.netlify.com/start">https://app.netlify.com/start</a></strong> and connect GitHub.</li>
      <li>Choose <strong><code>Akanksha-124/The-Daily-Brew</code></strong>.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>"Deploy Site"</strong>. Your free HTTPS link is generated immediately.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="proof-card">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1F1713;">Option C: Free GitHub Pages</h3>
    <ol style="margin-bottom: 4pt;">
      <li>Go to your repository: <strong><a href="https://github.com/Akanksha-124/The-Daily-Brew/settings/pages">https://github.com/Akanksha-124/The-Daily-Brew/settings/pages</a></strong></li>
      <li>Under <strong>Source</strong>, select <strong>"GitHub Actions"</strong>.</li>
      <li>The pre-configured <code>.github/workflows/deploy.yml</code> workflow will automatically build and publish your site at: <br>
      <code>https://akanksha-124.github.io/The-Daily-Brew/</code></li>
    </ol>
  </div>

