  <!-- ================= SECTION 3: THE COMPLETE DETAILED PROMPT ================= -->
  <h2>SECTION 3: The Complete Detailed Prompt (For PDF Export)</h2>
  <p>Below is the unabridged system prompt text used to engineer the entire application. We have also generated <strong><code>PROMPT_FOR_PDF_EXPORT.html</code></strong> in your project directory so you can export this section into an official PDF with 1 click.</p>

  <div class="code-box">
# PROJECT: THE DAILY BREW
### A Luxury Boutique Café | Coffee, Kitchen & Little Moments

Act as a world-class brand designer, luxury hospitality website designer, senior UI/UX designer and full-stack developer.

Transform THE DAILY BREW into an exceptionally elegant, sophisticated and premium café brand. Build a complete, functional, responsive café website and food-ordering application.

The website must look like an established luxury café or European boutique coffee house, not a generic restaurant template.

## 1. BRAND IDENTITY
Brand name: THE DAILY BREW
Brand positioning: Premium boutique café offering specialty coffee, handcrafted beverages, gourmet snacks, Italian pasta, artisan bakery and exquisite desserts.
Brand personality: Sophisticated, Timeless, Minimal, Warm, Elegant, Contemporary, Exclusive but welcoming.
Tagline: "A Little Luxury in Every Moment."

## 2. VISUAL DESIGN DIRECTION
Create an expensive-looking, editorial-style website inspired by luxury European cafés, Parisian coffee houses and contemporary boutique restaurants.
Colour palette:
- Warm ivory: #F7F3EB
- Soft champagne: #D9C6A5
- Espresso: #30231D
- Deep walnut: #49372D
- Muted taupe: #A99A88
- Soft white: #FFFEFA
Typography:
- Headings: Cormorant Garamond or Playfair Display.
- Body: DM Sans or Manrope.
- Use refined typography, elegant letter spacing and beautiful text hierarchy.
Design principles:
- Generous white space.
- Large editorial photography.
- Minimal navigation.
- Beautiful image compositions.
- Delicate borders and understated shadows.
- Elegant buttons with subtle hover effects.
- Refined transitions and micro-interactions.
- Sophisticated layouts with asymmetrical editorial sections.

Avoid:
- Bright colours.
- Neon gradients.
- Excessively rounded cards.
- Cartoon illustrations.
- Emoji decorations.
- Cheap-looking templates.
- Excessive animations.
- Overcrowded layouts.
- Generic AI-generated food visuals.

The website should look like a premium brand created by a professional international design agency.

## 3. PHOTOGRAPHY REQUIREMENTS
Photography is one of the most important parts of this project.
Use authentic, realistic, professional food and café photography.
Use properly licensed photographs from Unsplash or Pexels, preferably direct stable image URLs.
Photography should look like professional restaurant photography taken using a DSLR camera.

Required photography:
- Beautiful cappuccino with detailed latte art.
- Espresso served in elegant ceramic cups.
- Iced Spanish latte in transparent glasses.
- Specialty matcha beverages.
- Beautifully plated Italian pasta.
- Gourmet sandwiches and artisan toast.
- Premium cheesecakes and chocolate desserts.
- Freshly baked croissants and pastries.
- Luxury café interiors with natural sunlight.
- Coffee preparation and barista photography.

Photography style:
- Natural window lighting.
- Realistic food textures.
- Soft natural shadows.
- Warm neutral colour grading.
- Premium restaurant presentation.
- Shallow depth of field where appropriate.

Never use artificial 3D food renders, cartoon graphics or obviously AI-generated food images.
Every product must have its own relevant photograph. Do not reuse the same photograph across different menu products.
If an image fails to load, use a relevant fallback image.

## 4. WEBSITE NAVIGATION
Create a sophisticated navigation bar.
Logo: THE DAILY BREW
Navigation:
- Home
- Our Menu
- Our Story
- Experiences
- Offers
- Contact
Include:
- Minimal shopping bag icon.
- Live cart quantity indicator.
- Elegant mobile navigation.
- Sticky navigation with subtle background transition.

## 5. HOMEPAGE
Create an impressive luxury editorial homepage.
Hero section:
Use a large, breathtaking photograph of a beautiful premium café or an elegant coffee-and-pastry arrangement.
Headline: "Slow Down. Sip Something Beautiful."
Supporting text: "Thoughtfully crafted coffee, exquisite flavours and beautiful moments. Discover your everyday escape at The Daily Brew."
Buttons:
- Explore Our Menu
- Order Your Favourites
Additional sections:
A. Our Philosophy
B. Signature Selection
C. The Art of Coffee
D. From Our Kitchen
E. Something Sweet
F. The Daily Experience
G. Special Offers
H. Customer Experiences
I. Newsletter
J. Premium Footer

## 6. COMPLETE MENU CATALOGUE (37 PRODUCTS)
COFFEE:
1. Spanish Latte - ₹220
2. Caramel Macchiato - ₹240
3. Classic Cappuccino - ₹180
4. Hazelnut Latte - ₹230
5. Vanilla Cold Brew - ₹210
6. Mocha Frappe - ₹250
7. Classic Americano - ₹150

SIGNATURE BEVERAGES:
1. Strawberry Matcha Latte - ₹260
2. Blueberry Iced Tea - ₹190
3. Mango Passion Cooler - ₹210
4. Classic Hot Chocolate - ₹220
5. Iced Brown Sugar Latte - ₹230
6. Rose Milk Latte - ₹240

SNACKS:
1. Loaded Peri Peri Fries - ₹220
2. Cheesy Garlic Bread - ₹190
3. Truffle Mushroom Toast - ₹280
4. Crispy Chicken Strips - ₹290
5. Classic Veg Sandwich - ₹210
6. Pesto Grilled Sandwich - ₹260
7. Cheese Jalapeno Poppers - ₹230

PASTA:
1. Creamy Alfredo Pasta - ₹320
2. Spicy Arrabbiata Pasta - ₹290
3. Pink Sauce Pasta - ₹330
4. Pesto Basil Pasta - ₹340
5. Creamy Mushroom Pasta - ₹350
6. Chicken Alfredo Pasta - ₹390

DESSERTS:
1. Belgian Chocolate Brownie - ₹190
2. Lotus Biscoff Cheesecake - ₹280
3. Classic Tiramisu - ₹290
4. New York Cheesecake - ₹270
5. Chocolate Lava Cake - ₹240
6. Red Velvet Pastry - ₹220
7. Blueberry Cheesecake - ₹280

BAKERY:
1. Butter Croissant - ₹160
2. Chocolate Croissant - ₹190
3. Cinnamon Roll - ₹180
4. Almond Danish - ₹210

## 7. PRODUCT DETAILS MODAL
Display large product photograph, product name, detailed description, price, dietary information, quantity selector, and Add to Bag button.

## 8. SHOPPING BAG & PRIVILEGES
Strictly use "Shopping Bag" terminology.
Features:
- Add products, remove products, increase/decrease quantity.
- Subtotal, 5% GST hospitality tax, complimentary delivery calculation.
- Working coupons: BREW10 (10% off), FIRST50 (₹50 off orders above ₹299).
- LocalStorage persistence.

## 9. CHECKOUT & DEMO ORDER TRACKING
- Customer info validation.
- Delivery vs. Store pickup toggle.
- Demo payment options (UPI, Card, Net Banking, COD).
- Order confirmation with unique ID and simulated 4-stage tracking timeline.
